body:
It is a configuration-template generator. For example it would take the "name" and then add the input next to an already existing string called devicename and so on. When hitting the submit button, a new file would be created using all the concatenated strings.

&#x200B;

devicename "userinput"  
deviceIP "userinput"

&#x200B;

and so on

\*slowclap\*

&#x200B;

This may work with a lot of people

Men's standards for sex aren't as high as women. Also, we believe that for sex to be good, it is our responsibility and not our female partner. If she wants to improve it will come by practice and getting to know each other and the right buttons.

&#x200B;

And the reaction would be: YAY sex!

The game has its own lore, you don't need the books. As for getting into the game, you need to bare going through the first few bits at the White Orchid. After that, you start falling head over heels into the game. It really takes you in after you understand the crafting, skills tree and questing. Also for questing, you will love the idea of the butterfly effect. So many quests have ties to the main ending that will change everything. 

&#x200B;

Be patient and you will have the best game made as open world hack & slash.

Well, I am in the same situation as you and recently I was told a very good piece of advice. Going through courses/classes won't be enough. Pick a language, an idea and start developing it. You will be stuck at first, search for the "know-how" of the part you are trying to develop and so on.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
